    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d482">

                <pb facs="0608" n="506" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg506"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 13329/1–3.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Emperor of Japan to President
                    Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-05-02"><hi rendition="#italic">May 2,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The great sympathy which you have so earnestly expressed on account of the
                    terrible disaster to our warship <hi rendition="#italic">Matsushima</hi> has
                    touched me very deeply, and I hope you will accept for yourself and the American
                    people my sincere thanks.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mutsuhito.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
